# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# Format: <source>  <destination>  <status>
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# /works → /writing
#
# The nav label is "Works" but the canonical route remains
# `/writing.html` (clean-URL rewritten to `/writing` by Pages). This
# 301 makes the implied URL bar match the label: a user typing
# `bajwa.auraplatform.org/works` lands on the same page the nav link
# takes them to. Permanent (301) so search engines consolidate ranking
# on /writing — which is the canonical link target in every internal
# href.
/works  /writing  301
